<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. da Vinci returns four weeks after the diagnosis, ten weeks after the fall. He wears the night elbow splint every night and the anti-claw splint during the day, and keeps his elbow off the drawing table. Hand therapy began only two weeks ago, because the clinic&apos;s hand therapist had no openings sooner; he has had four sessions and does his exercises at home. The numbness of the little finger is a little less, and the elbow no longer aches, so he has stopped acetaminophen. His grip is about the same. He draws, writes, and teaches every day with his left hand and has tried painting a small panel with a palette fixed to the easel. He takes atorvastatin each evening without muscle aches. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Splints</td><td>Night elbow splint and daytime anti-claw splint worn as advised</td></tr><tr><td>Hand therapy</td><td>Began two weeks ago, two weeks after the referral; four sessions</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>Numbness a little less; strength unchanged; no elbow pain</td></tr><tr><td>Statin</td><td>No missed doses; no muscle aches</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.18"/>
    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Right little finger numbness improving; weak grip; no new symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No elbow pain; no muscle aches</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>2 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

